From f7dd224759a826cc1abbb4fe4c562a582dcdbd44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:24:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/21] Physical/special split and modern stats, moves,
 learnsets

- Per-move category (.split) drives damage calc, Hustle, Counter/Mirror Coat
- Thick Fat halves Attack too; Fury Cutter capped at 160 power
- Modern base stats, move power/accuracy/PP, and newest level-up
  learnsets (Gen 1-3 moves only), generated by tools/hack/modernize.py

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
 include/battle.h                      |    7 +
 include/pokemon.h                     |    1 +
 src/battle_script_commands.c          |    8 +-
 src/data/battle_moves.h               |  569 +-
